feat(completa tu perfil): jump to the exact field (opens its section) + count any description

- Each completion item now opens the matching collapsed section in the profile
  editor AND smooth-scrolls to the exact field, with a brief brand-blue flash.
  Sections in ProfileEditor are now controlled (open state lifted), and the
  editor takes focusField/focusKey props; field→section map drives the open.
  data-field anchors added (photo, bio, location, whatsapp, insurers). Works on
  mobile (scroll-mt + smooth scrollIntoView).
- Description completion: any non-empty bio now counts (removed the >=40 char
  gate, so "test" marks it done).

